 <div class="dc-summary-card dc-summary-live"><div class="dc-summary-top"><span class="dc-summary-icon" aria-hidden="true">●</span><span class="dc-summary-label">Visitors online</span><span class="dc-summary-pill">LIVE</span></div><div class="dc-summary-value" id="dc-active-count">{$dongchat_counts.active_visitors|intval}</div><div class="dc-summary-bottom">Active in the last 60 seconds</div></div>
