</div><div data-dc-panel="analytics" hidden><section class="dc-history" aria-label="Visitor history"><h3>Visitor history &amp; analytics</h3><p>Recorded chat-widget sessions, not all website traffic. Location and device values are approximate. Totals reflect retained records.</p><label>Period <select id="dc-history-days"><option value="7">7 days</option><option value="30" selected>30 days</option><option value="90">90 days</option></select></label> <button type="button" id="dc-history-refresh" class="btn btn-default">Refresh history</button><p id="dc-history-summary">Loading history...</p><div class="dc-history-groups"><div><strong>Top countries</strong><ol id="dc-history-countries"></ol></div><div><strong>Top cities</strong><ol id="dc-history-cities"></ol></div><div><strong>Devices</strong><ol id="dc-history-devices"></ol></div><div><strong>Pages</strong><ol id="dc-history-pages"></ol></div></div><div class="dc-table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>First seen</th><th>Visitor</th><th>Location</th><th>Device</th><th>Page</th></tr></thead><tbody id="dc-history-rows"></tbody></table></div><button type="button" class="btn btn-default" id="dc-history-prev">Previous</button> <span id="dc-history-page"></span> <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" id="dc-history-next">Next</button></section></div><div data-dc-panel="settings" hidden><section class="dc-retention"><h4>Data retention</h4><p>0 means keep indefinitely. Cleanup runs only when you click Run cleanup; it deletes at most 500 records of each type per run. Visitor records with retained chat messages are preserved.</p><label>Visitor activity <select id="dc-retention-visitors"><option value="0">Keep indefinitely</option><option value="30">30 days</option><option value="60">60 days</option><option value="90">90 days</option><option value="180">180 days</option><option value="365">365 days</option></select></label> <label>Chat messages <select id="dc-retention-messages"><option value="0">Keep indefinitely</option><option value="90">90 days</option><option value="180">180 days</option><option value="365">365 days</option><option value="730">730 days</option></select></label> <button type="button" id="dc-retention-save" class="btn btn-default">Save policy</button> <button type="button" id="dc-retention-run" class="btn btn-default">Run cleanup</button><p id="dc-retention-status" role="status"></p></section>
</div><div data-dc-panel="leads" hidden><section class="dc-leads" aria-label="Customer leads"><h3>Customer Leads</h3><p>Visitors with a saved name, email address or phone number. Only authorized back-office staff should access or export this information.</p><form method="get" action="{$dongchat_admin_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}" class="dc-leads-search"><input type="hidden" name="controller" value="AdminDongLiveChat"><input type="hidden" name="token" value="{$dongchat_admin_token|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}"><input type="hidden" name="dc_tab" value="leads"><label>Search name, email, phone or notes <input type="search" name="dc_lead_q" value="{$dongchat_lead_query|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}" maxlength="100" placeholder="Search saved leads"></label> <button class="btn btn-default" type="submit">Search</button> <a class="btn btn-default" href="{$dongchat_lead_export_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">Export matching leads (CSV)</a></form><p>{$dongchat_lead_total|intval} lead records found. Page {$dongchat_lead_page|intval} of {$dongchat_lead_pages|intval}.</p><div class="dc-table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Visitor</th><th>Name</th><th>Email</th><th>Phone</th><th>City / Country</th><th>Device</th><th>Last activity</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>{foreach from=$dongchat_leads item=lead}<tr><td>#{$lead.id_visitor|intval}</td><td>{$lead.name|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$lead.email|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$lead.phone|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$lead.geo_city|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}, {$lead.geo_country|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$lead.device_os|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$lead.last_seen|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td><a href="{$dongchat_admin_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}&amp;dc_visitor={$lead.id_visitor|intval}">Open chat</a></td></tr>{foreachelse}<tr><td colspan="8">No saved leads match your search.</td></tr>{/foreach}</tbody></table></div><div class="dc-lead-pagination">{if $dongchat_lead_page > 1}<a class="btn btn-default" href="{$dongchat_lead_prev_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">Previous</a>{/if} {if $dongchat_lead_page < $dongchat_lead_pages}<a class="btn btn-default" href="{$dongchat_lead_next_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">Next</a>{/if}</div></section></div><div data-dc-panel="visits"{if $dongchat_open_tab != 'visits'} hidden{/if}><section class="dc-leads" aria-label="Visit history"><h3>Website Visit History</h3><p>Recorded page visits by chat-widget sessions. Each page change is logged; a return to the same page after 30 minutes is a new visit. Repeated heartbeats are not counted. Not all website traffic is captured.</p><p>{$dongchat_visit_total|intval} recorded page visits. Page {$dongchat_visit_page|intval} of {$dongchat_visit_pages|intval}.</p><div class="dc-table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Date and time</th><th>Visitor</th><th>City / Country</th><th>Page</th><th>Page title</th></tr></thead><tbody>{foreach from=$dongchat_visits item=visit}<tr><td>{$visit.visited_at|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td><a href="{$dongchat_admin_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}&amp;dc_visitor={$visit.id_visitor|intval}">#{$visit.id_visitor|intval}{if $visit.name} — {$visit.name|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{/if}</a></td><td>{$visit.geo_city|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}, {$visit.geo_country|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{if $visit.page_url && $visit.page_path}<a href="{$visit.page_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{$visit.page_path|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</a>{else}{$visit.page_path|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{/if}</td><td>{$visit.page_title|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td></tr>{foreachelse}<tr><td colspan="5">No visits recorded yet. New visits appear after the module update.</td></tr>{/foreach}</tbody></table></div><div class="dc-lead-pagination">{if $dongchat_visit_page > 1}<a class="btn btn-default" href="{$dongchat_visit_prev_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">Previous</a>{/if} {if $dongchat_visit_page < $dongchat_visit_pages}<a class="btn btn-default" href="{$dongchat_visit_next_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">Next</a>{/if}</div></section></div><div data-dc-panel="live"{if $dongchat_open_tab == 'visits'} hidden style="display:none"{/if}><p id="dc-status" role="status">Loading visitor inbox...</p>
<div class="dc-layout"><aside><div class="dc-table-scroll"><table class="table dc-table"><thead><tr><th>Visitor</th><th>IP address</th><th>Country / City</th><th>Device / OS</th><th>Referring website</th><th>Current page</th><th>Last active</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="dc-visitors">
{foreach from=$dongchat_initial_visitors item=v}<tr data-visitor-id="{$v.id_visitor|intval}"><td><a class="dc-choose" data-visitor-id="{$v.id_visitor|intval}" href="{$dongchat_admin_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}&amp;dc_visitor={$v.id_visitor|intval}">Visitor #{$v.id_visitor|intval}{if $v.name} — {$v.name|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{/if}</a></td><td>{$v.ip_address|default:'Not recorded'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$v.geo_city|default:'Unknown'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}, {$v.geo_country|default:'Unknown'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$v.device_os|default:'Unknown'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td class="dc-page" title="{$v.referrer_url|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">{$v.referrer_url|default:'Not provided'|truncate:55:'…'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td class="dc-page" title="{$v.current_page|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">{$v.current_page|truncate:70:'…'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>{$v.last_seen|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</td><td>—</td></tr>{foreachelse}<tr><td colspan="8">No visitors recorded yet.</td></tr>{/foreach}
</tbody></table></div></aside><main><h3 id="dc-selected">{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}Visitor #{$dongchat_selected_visitor.id_visitor|intval}{else}Select a visitor{/if}</h3><div id="dc-visitor-identity" class="dc-visitor-identity" aria-live="polite"><div><strong>Visitor number:</strong> <span id="dc-detail-number">{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}#{$dongchat_selected_visitor.id_visitor|intval}{else}Not selected{/if}</span></div><div><strong>IP address:</strong> <span id="dc-detail-address">{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}{$dongchat_selected_visitor.ip_address|default:'Not recorded'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{else}Not selected{/if}</span></div><div><strong>Country / City:</strong> <span id="dc-detail-geo">Not available</span></div><div><strong>Device / OS:</strong> <span id="dc-detail-device">Not available</span></div></div><p><strong>Page title:</strong> <span id="dc-detail-title">{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}{$dongchat_selected_visitor.page_title|default:'Not available'|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{else}Not available{/if}</span></p><p id="dc-detail-ip">{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}Current page: {$dongchat_selected_visitor.current_page|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{else}Current page: Not available{/if}</p><form id="dc-profile"><h4>Visitor details</h4><input id="dc-name" value="{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}{$dongchat_selected_visitor.name|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{/if}" maxlength="160" placeholder="Name"><input id="dc-email" value="{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}{$dongchat_selected_visitor.email|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{/if}" type="email" maxlength="254" placeholder="Email"><input id="dc-phone" value="{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}{$dongchat_selected_visitor.phone|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{/if}" maxlength="50" placeholder="Phone number"><textarea id="dc-notes" maxlength="5000" placeholder="Internal notes">{if $dongchat_selected_visitor}{$dongchat_selected_visitor.notes|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}{/if}</textarea><button type="submit" class="btn btn-default">Save visitor details</button></form><div id="dc-messages">{foreach from=$dongchat_selected_messages item=m}<div class="dc-line {$m.sender|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}">{$m.sender|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}: {$m.body|escape:'html':'UTF-8'}</div>{/foreach}</div><form id="dc-form"><textarea id="dc-input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Write to visitor" required></textarea><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send message</button></form></main></div></div></div>
